<title>POLAND: POLISH PEUGEOT, CITROEN UNITS SELL PLN 4 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>POLISH PEUGEOT, CITROEN UNITS SELL PLN 4 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish units of Peugeot and Citroen sold four million zlotys worth of one-month commercial papers (KWITs) issued under a 30-million zloty borrowing programme managed by ING Bank Warsaw.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement the papers were sold with yields of 18.30 percent.</p>
<p>The borrowing was launched in December 1995.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
